Package: nbzinbKnight
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Robert", "Knight", , "knightrt@miamioh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits negative binomial (NB2) regression by iteratively
    reweighted least squares (IRLS) for the coefficients, alternated with
    Newton-Raphson updates for the dispersion parameter theta. Fits
    zero-inflated negative binomial regression by an EM algorithm whose
    M-steps are IRLS fits. Results are checked against MASS::glm.nb() and
    pscl::zeroinfl(). Developed as the STA 651 final project.
